<title>USA: MicroTel wins $2.34 million order.</title>
<headline>MicroTel wins $2.34 million order.</headline>
<dateline>ONTARIO, Calif. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>MicroTel International Inc said AT&amp;T Corp division, AT&amp;T Network and Computing Services, has placed a $2.34 million telecommunications equipment order with MicroTel unit CXR Telecom.</p>
<p>AT&amp;T has ordered an Integrated Remote Test Node System to evaluate the automated performance of its telecommunications network as it expands into local markets, MicroTel said in a statement issued on Tuesday.</p>
<p>MicroTel management expects rising demand for its test equipment as competition increases for telephone services in the United States.</p>
</text>
